This project re-implements the model of Shiu et al. (2024), whose original
Brian2 code (https://github.com/philshiu/Drosophila_brain_model) is
MIT-licensed, Copyright (c) 2023 Philip Shiu and Nico Spiller.
The connectome data is produced by the FlyWire consortium (https://flywire.ai)
and is downloaded at run time; it is not redistributed in this repository and
remains subject to FlyWire's own terms of use.
